// Title: Winrar Compressing Dump Files
// ID: 1ac14d38-3dfc-4635-92c7-e3fd1c5f5bfc
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-01-04
// Tags: attack.collection, attack.t1560.001
// Description: Detects execution of WinRAR in order to compress a file with a ".dmp"/".dump" extension, which could be a step in a process of dump file exfiltration.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((process.command_line like "*_.dmp*" or process.command_line like "*_.dump*" or process.command_line like "*_.hdmp*")) and (((process.executable endswith "\\rar.exe" or process.executable endswith "\\winrar.exe")) or (Description == "Command line RAR")))
